.TH TG-EXPERT 1
.SH NAME
tg-expert \- a program for timing mechanical watches
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B tg-expert
.RI [ file.tgj ...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
tg-expert (tg-expert) is a program to evaluate the performance of mechanical
watch movements. It works with the noise produced by a watch mechanism, and it
produces real-time readings of the rate (or accuracy) and various other
operational parameters.
.PP
tg-expert is based on Tg by Marcello Mamino and contributors, and on its
continuation tg-timer by Alejandro Grigera.
